01:04:30,000 --> 01:04:36,000
Enola Holmes 2 is a 2022 mystery film and the sequel to the 2020 film Enola Holmes, both of which star Millie Bobby Brown as the title
character, the teenage sister of the already-famous Victorian-era detective Sherlock Holmes (portrayed by Henry Cavill).

11
01:10:57,000 --> 01:11:03,000
The film is directed by Harry Bradbeer from a screenplay by Jack Thorne that
adapts the book series The Enola Holmes Mysteries by Nancy Springer.

12
01:17:24,000 --> 01:17:30,000
Unlike the film's predecessor, it does not adapt one of Springer's novels and
instead takes real-life inspiration from the matchgirls' strike.

13
01:23:51,000 --> 01:23:57,000
In addition to Brown and Cavill, Louis Partridge, Susie Wokoma, Adeel Akhtar, and Helena Bonham Carter
reprise their supporting roles while David Thewlis and Sharon Duncan-Brewster join the cast.

14
01:30:18,000 --> 01:30:24,000
Filming began in Autumn 2021 and ended in January 2022.

15
01:36:45,000 --> 01:36:51,000
Enola Holmes 2 was released on Netflix on November 4, 2022.

16
01:43:12,000 --> 01:43:18,000
The film received positive reviews from critics and topped
Netflix's viewership charts in 93 countries.

